-Did you feel overlooked las
year as a beautiful 39-year-old?

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I absolutely did.
I was angry. I was upset.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
