stronger this year

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:20.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
and honestly,
I'm campaigning now for 41

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:21.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-Yeah.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, that would
be heartbreaking

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:25.785
if you don't get it, 'caus
that would just be an indictment

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.720
of what has happened to your
beauty over course of the year

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.891
-Yes, and so quickly, I woul
fall. I would fall from grace.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
