00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:43.937 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I think it is.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:46.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think it's very
well deserved.

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.373 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
