00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. So, this is hard to say
and it was midday.

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.626
I was -- Just gotten out o
the bath and, believe it or not,

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:09.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
