00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:29.082 line:92%
We have to multi-task, Seth.

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.650 line:92%
You can get a lot done in there.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.219 line:92%
You can put a laptop on a caddy.

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:35.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This past year,
a lot of people thrived

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:36.823 line:92%
in both the bed and the bath

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:41.895
Did you find yourself to be well
prepared for what beset us all

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:45.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No one was more prepared
for this pandemic than I was

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.766 line:92%
It was such a smooth transitio

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
as someone who needs
to be submerged in water

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:53.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a down comforter
